1
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:03,813
{\an8}SKERRY POINT LIGHTHOUSE

2
00:00:04,213 --> 00:00:05,775
[wind buffeting a window]

3
00:00:06,175 --> 00:00:09,238
MARTA: The lamp is out.
IVO: The lamp is not out.

4
00:00:09,638 --> 00:00:10,838
IVO: It is resting.

5
00:00:11,238 --> 00:00:12,438
[foghorn, distant]

6
00:00:12,838 --> 00:00:14,400
MARTA: It is a lamp, Ivo.

7
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:16,000
[kettle whistling]

8
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:17,963
MARTA: Go and look at it.

9
00:00:18,362 --> 00:00:20,487
IVO: I am looking at it from here.

10
00:00:20,887 --> 00:00:22,087
[chair scraping]

11
00:00:22,487 --> 00:00:24,175
MARTA: Ninety-eight stairs.

12
00:00:24,575 --> 00:00:26,512
IVO (from below): Ninety-seven!

13
00:00:26,912 --> 00:00:28,725
[footsteps ascending, slowly]

14
00:00:29,125 --> 00:00:31,000
♪ Roll on, roll on, my heart ♪

15
00:00:31,400 --> 00:00:33,337
♪ The light will find you yet ♪

16
00:00:33,737 --> 00:00:34,987
[machinery clunking]

17
00:00:35,387 --> 00:00:36,587
[the lamp igniting]

18
00:00:36,987 --> 00:00:38,187
MARTA: It is on.

19
00:00:38,587 --> 00:00:40,025
IVO: So it was resting.

20
00:00:40,425 --> 00:00:41,625
MARTA: Do not.

21
00:00:42,025 --> 00:00:43,225
[gulls screaming]

22
00:00:43,625 --> 00:00:44,825
IVO: Nine of them.

23
00:00:45,225 --> 00:00:46,600
MARTA (sighing): Nine.

24
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:48,200
[wind rising]

25
00:00:48,600 --> 00:00:50,412
[the light turning, rhythmic]

26
00:00:50,812 --> 00:00:52,012
IVO: Marta?

27
00:00:52,412 --> 00:00:53,912
MARTA: Still holding it.

28
00:00:54,312 --> 00:00:55,512
[music swells]

